    Repository : https://github.com/hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset
    Licence    : MIT
    Copyright  : Copyright (c) 2026 Hasan Emir Yıldırım

Used in accordance with that licence, which requires the copyright notice and
permission notice to be retained in all copies or substantial portions of the
