## Exercise media is not redistributed

No exercise media — thumbnails or animation GIFs — is redistributed by this
project. The upstream MEDIA EXCEPTION removes the dataset's `images/` and
`videos/` directories from its MIT grant: that media is © Gym Visual
(https://gymvisual.com/), included upstream with the rights holder's written
permission, and governed by Gym Visual's own Terms & Conditions. Cloning the
dataset confers no licence to that media, so publishing it from this project
would infringe whatever the rest of the dataset permits.

The exercise visuals that do ship are drawn by `app/js/diagrams.js`: original
animated vector geometry generated from the dataset's MIT-licensed metadata
fields (category, muscle, muscleGroup, target, equipment, secondaryMuscles).
They are not derived from any third-party artwork.

`app/media/README.md` documents the empty slot that accepts media a downstream
user does hold rights to, with the attribution Gym Visual's terms require
("© Gym visual — https://gymvisual.com/") pre-wired as the default credit.

